at:","options":["Mechanization reduces labor","Yield per acre increases with technology","Soil mining is sustainable","Farmers need more land"],"correctOption":1,"section":"Comprehension & Summary"}},{"itemId":"65e757e2-4903-5c3d-b275-9787eb5faae1","courseId":"40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000008","kind":"cbt_question","questionId":"40a7729f-f8bf-425c-a3fe-f965c740cafa","sourceKey":"quiz:98","parentItemId":null,"payload":{"prompt":"In the financial success paragraph, success is measured by:","options":["Total profit","Profit relative to investment","Employee satisfaction","Market share"],"correctOption":1,"section":"Comprehension & Summary"}},{"itemId":"4f5a03d3-bae2-501c-9f75-bb8e6320b2f7","courseId":"40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000008","kind":"cbt_question","questionId":"33e30697-6c0d-4f72-9722-1e6dce687415","sourceKey":"quiz:99","parentItemId":null,"payload":{"prompt":"The English Statute of Labourers aimed to:","options":["Increase wages","Freeze wages at pre-plague levels","Encourage strikes","Train new workers"],"correctOption":1,"section":"Comprehension & Summary"}},{"itemId":"c2d905dc-6c49-5318-aa0c-4bf9d0a6c371","courseId":"40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000008","kind":"cbt_question","questionId":"32269e54-f0a0-4726-8e56-96feff4a2975","sourceKey":"quiz:100","parentItemId":null,"payload":{"prompt":"The French statute of 1351 allowed wage increases up to:","options":["50%","One-third","10%","No increase"],"correctOption":1,"section":"Comprehension & Summary"}},{"itemId":"bba5d149-4d82-5584-a1e9-c89fc82e7c84","courseId":"40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000009","kind":"course_overview","questionId":null,"sourceKey":"course-overview","parentItemId":null,"payload":{"title":"Nigerian Peoples and Culture","body":"A General Studies course surveying Nigerian peoples and culture. It covers the concept, characteristics and components of culture; an ethno-historical survey of Nigeria's major groups and geopolitical zones; the roles of Christianity and Islam in political 